<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - USLIFE raised to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - USLIFE raised to outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroeder Wertheim said analyst Andrew Kligerman raised his recommendation on USLIFE to outperform from perform-in-line.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 2-3/8 at 38-5/8 in early afternoon NYSE trade.</p>
